 rty (~150 headphone sets\, $10 reservation). Starts 11am in the food court
 . Part of the Aug 8 farewell day (Lloyderpalooza\, Pedalpalooza funeral ri
 de\, Lloyd Fest 4-7pm).\nAddress: 2201 Lloyd Center\, Portland\, OR 97232\
 nWebsite: https://foodcourt5k.com/\nDetails: 1980s/90s-themed indoor mall 
 walking. Dress code: neon leggings\, acid-washed denim encouraged. Groups 
 of 70+ regular attendees. Post-walk snacks at food court. Lloyd Center clo
 ses permanently August 8\, 2026 - the last regular Sunday walk inside the 
 mall is August 2\, with a final farewell walk on Saturday August 8. The gr
 oup continues afterward at rotating pop-up locations around Portland (some
  outdoors for late summer\, some indoors)\; a permanent home is reportedly
  close to being finalized but was not announced as of late July 2026.
LOCATION:2201 Lloyd Center\, Portland\, OR 97232
URL:https://foodcourt5k.com/
CATEGORIES:Fitness & Wellness
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
